OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister to face
OL,4,Ano-confidence vote over Drumcree row
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's First Minister
OL,7,FMichelle O'Neill is to face a
OL,8,Fno-confidence vote at Stormont over her
OL,9,Fhandling of the Drumcree parading
OL,10,Fdispute.
OL,12,FThe motions against her and three other
OL,13,FSinn Fein ministers are set to be
OL,14,Fdebated after receiving the backing of
OL,15,Funionist parties.
OL,17,FBut the attempt to oust them will fail
OL,18,Fas it requires cross-community support
OL,19,Ffrom a majority of both unionists and
OL,20,Fnationalists in the assembly.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
